<title>GERMANY: Bayernwerk VIAG - raises stake in Bayern.</title>
<headline>Bayernwerk VIAG - raises stake in Bayern.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German utility Bayernwerk said on Tuesday that it would raise its stake in Bayerngas to 22 percent from 10 percent.</p>
<p>Bayernwerk is a subsidiary of Viag AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
